                                text="&lt;p>Pre viac informácií o partnerstve s AbbVie si&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;/content/dam/abbvie-com2/pdfs/partnership-approach-brochure.pdf&quot;>stiahnite našu brožúru.&lt;/a>&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
